          "code": "COLLECTOUTPUTS",
          "id": "1762440645385",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1762440645386_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "1. Take the entire output of {{$context.$nodes.CALLCONFIGURATIONSOBJECT.$output.result}} as assign the response to the EmploymentConfigurationsObject\n\n2. If the \"isProposedJobPresent\" - {{$context.$variables.message.isProposedJobPresent}} is true, extract the JobId, JobName, and JobCode from the {{$context.$nodes.JOBSEARCHBO.$output}}. If \"isProposedJobPresent\" is false, default the JobId, JobName, and JobCode from the EmploymentConfigurationsObject.\n\n3. If the \"isProposedGradePresent\" - {{$context.$variables.message.isProposedGradePresent}} is true, extract the GradeId, GradeName, and GradeCode from the {{$context.$nodes.GRADESEARCHBO.$output}}. If \"isProposedGradePresent\" is false, default the GradeId, GradeName, and GradeCode from the EmploymentConfigurationsObject.\n\n4. If the \"isProposedActionPresent - {{$context.$variables.message.isProposedActionPresent}} is true, extract the ActionId, ActionName, and ActionCode from the {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_ACTIONS_BO.$output}}. If the \"isProposedActionPresent is false, default the ActionName and ActionCode from the EmploymentConfigurationsObject.\n\n5. If the \"isProposedActionReasonPresent\" - {{$context.$variables.message.isProposedActionReasonPresent}} is true, extract the ActionReasonId, ActionReasonName, and ActionReasonCode from the {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_ACTION_REASON_BO.$output}}. Otherwise, set the ActionReasonName, ActionReasonId, and ActionReasonCode to 'NA'.\n\n6. Extract the PerformanceRating in the form of 'A/B' from the {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_PERFORMANCE_BUSINESS_OBJECT.$output}}. If the Performance Rating is not Available, assign \"Not Available\" to the PerformanceRating.\n\n7. Extract the JobSeniority in the form of 'X Years, Y Months and Z Days' from the {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_JOB_SENIORITY.$output}} . If the JobSeniority is not Available, assign \"Not Available\" to the JobSeniority.\n\n8. Extract the EnterpriseSeniority in the form of 'X Years, Y Months and Z Days' from the {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_ENTERPRISE_SENIORITY_DETAILS.$output}} . If the EnterpriseSeniority is not Available, assign \"Not Available\" to the EnterpriseSeniority.\n\n9. Extract the Salary Amount and Currency in the form of 'A-Amount C-Currency' from the {{$context.$nodes.FETCH_SALARY.$output}} and assign it to the Salary.\n\n10. From the PromotionComplainceDocument  - {{$context.$nodes.COMPLAINCE_DOCUMENT.$output.value}} understand the required enterprise seniority as per the compliance document and set the requiredEnterpriseSeniorityAsPerCompliance. (Country can be found within EmploymentConfigurationsObject). If the PromotionComplainceDocument doesn't have the required enterprise seniority, then set requiredEnterpriseSeniorityAsPerCompliance to \"Not Available\".\n\n11. From the PromotionCriteriaDocument - {{$context.$nodes.EXTRACTREQUIREDDATAFROMRAG.$output}} understand and set the required job seniority and performance rating as per the promotion Criteria document. If the PromotionCriteriaDocument doesn't have the required job seniority, then set requiredJobSeniorityAsPerCriteriaDocument to \"Not Available\". Also, if the PromotionCriteriaDocument doesn't have the required performance rating, then set requiredPerformanceRatingAsPerCriteriaDocument to \"Not Available\".\n\n12. If criteria are met as per the promotion criteria document, then set eligibleAsPerPromotionCriteriaDocument to true\n\n13. If criteria are met as per the promotion compliance document, then set eligibleAsPerPromotionComplainceDocument to true"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"requiredPerformanceRatingAsPerCriteriaDocument\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"requiredJobSeniorityAsPerCriteriaDocument\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"requiredEnterpriseSeniorityAsPerCompliance\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"eligibleAsPerPromotionCriteriaDocument\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        },\n        \"eligibleAsPerPromotionComplainceDocument\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        },\n        \"ActionReasonId\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ActionId\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"GradeId\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"JobId\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"GradeCode\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"GradeName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"JobCode\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"JobName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"SalaryAmount\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"PerformanceRating\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"EnterpriseSeniority\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"JobSeniority\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"GeneratedManagerNotes\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"EmploymentConfigurationsObject\": {\n            \"type\": \"object\",\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"AssignmentMap\": {\n                \"type\":  [\"object\", \"null\"]\n              },\n              \"ProfileOptionsMap\": {\n                \"type\":  [\"object\", \"null\"]\n              },\n              \"ActionOccurrenceMap\": {\n                \"type\":  [\"object\", \"null\"]\n              },\n              \"SeniorityMap\": {\n                \"type\":  [\"object\", \"null\"]\n              }\n            },\n            \"required\": [\n              \"AssignmentMap\",\n              \"ProfileOptionsMap\",\n              \"ActionOccurrenceMap\",\n              \"SeniorityMap\"\n            ]\n        },\n        \"ActionReasonCode\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ActionCode\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ActionReasonName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ActionName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
