          "code": "PROMOTION_CRITERIA_DOCUMENT",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1762508218921",
          "id": "1762769408202",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1762769408207_1",
              "name": "question",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Extract the Review Period Name, Performance Document Name, Required Job Seniority, Required Performance Rating, General Rules for Promotion"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"title\": \"AnswerWithCitations\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"value\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"The answer text.\"\n    },\n    \"citations\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"description\": \"List of citations relevant to the answer.\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"citedText\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"The cited text.\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"citedText\"\n        ],\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"value\",\n    \"citations\"\n  ],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
          "type": "RAG_DOCUMENT_TOOL"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_completion_tokens": 32000,
                "reasoning_effort": "low"
              },
              "code": "ORA_MODEL_CONFIG_PREMIUM_OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
              "model": "OCI_GPT_5_MINI",
              "modelName": "Gpt-5 Mini",
              "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
            },
            "name": "ExtractRequiredDataFromRAG"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1767902374123"
          },
          "code": "EXTRACTREQUIREDDATAFROMRAG",
          "id": "1762771219132",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1762771219137_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Summary Text - {{$context.$nodes.PROMOTION_CRITERIA_DOCUMENT.$output.value}}\nisProposedJobPresent - {{$context.$variables.message.isProposedJobPresent}}\nproposedJobName - {{$context.$variables.message.proposedJobName}}\n\nExtract the following from the Summary Text. The \"isProposedJobPresent\" and \"proposedJobName\" are the parameters for the extraction logic\n1. Extract the RequiredPerformancerating in the format of \"A/B\"\n2. Extract the RequiredJobSeniority in the format of \"X years, Y months, and Z days\"\n3. Extract the PerformanceDocumentName \n4. Extract the PerformanceReviewPeriod \n5. Extract the GeneralRulesForPromotion\n\nFrom the \"proposedJobName\" and GeneralRulesForPromotion, understand if any rule is being violated. If yes, set the GeneralRulesForPromotionAreViolated flag to true."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"GeneralRulesForPromotionAreViolated\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        },\n        \"GeneralRulesForPromotion\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"RequiredJobSeniority\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"RequiredPerformancerating\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"PerformanceDocumentName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"PerformanceReviewPeriod\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "setPerformanceVariables"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1762508218921"
          },
